<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-BAYFIELD PULLS OUT OF PUMAS TOUR.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-BAYFIELD PULLS OUT OF PUMAS TOUR.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lock forward Martin Bayfield pulled out of the squad for England's imminent tour of Argentina with a recurring groin injury on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Bayfield, who has won 31 caps, had struggled for fitness all season. England have not named a replacement.</p>
</text>
